### 2) Defaulting the registrationDate to the server date

`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/DefaultOwnerRegistrationDate.java`

```java
public class DefaultOwnerRegistrationDate {
    public void service(@Val Owner owner) {
        if (owner.getRegistrationDate() == null) {
            owner.setRegistrationDate(LocalDate.now());
        }
